(4234249, 608183, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint, interesting subject. If only the sharpness at the bottom of the silhouette held for the top. Composition wise, I would have lost some more of the left hand side to put the figure into a third rather than towards the center</td>', 'Great viewpoint, interesting subject. If only the sharpness at the bottom of the silhouette held for the top. Composition wise, I would have lost some more of the left hand side to put the figure into a third rather than towards the center', '2007-11-09 08:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
