(4234618, 609798, 49109, '<td valign="top">The arrangement looks too staged, especially the placement of the knife. DOF is a bit shallow, had preferred to have at least a part of the mushroom sauce in focus. Your lighting is very good, considered you had only one light source. Composition works, but as mentioned, I had placed the knife the other way round. Don''t think, the black background helps the image, the kitchen floor or the kitchen counter had given the image a more realistic feel.</td>', 'The arrangement looks too staged, especially the placement of the knife. DOF is a bit shallow, had preferred to have at least a part of the mushroom sauce in focus. Your lighting is very good, considered you had only one light source. Composition works, but as mentioned, I had placed the knife the other way round. Don''t think, the black background helps the image, the kitchen floor or the kitchen counter had given the image a more realistic feel.', '2007-11-09 12:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234620, 608663, 49109, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, but the sun is still no artificial light source as far as I know</td>', 'beautiful shot, but the sun is still no artificial light source as far as I know', '2007-11-09 12:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
