(4235308, 609825, 63503, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, very creative and with a great resulting effect, however, you have clearly utilized 2 sources of light: 1)ambient tungstene light in the outside, probably from street lights, providing for the warm colors to the outside of the car and the steering wheel,  and 2) a flash inside the car, so, unfortunately, it does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, very creative and with a great resulting effect, however, you have clearly utilized 2 sources of light: 1)ambient tungstene light in the outside, probably from street lights, providing for the warm colors to the outside of the car and the steering wheel,  and 2) a flash inside the car, so, unfortunately, it does not meet the challenge.', '2007-11-09 17:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
