(4235313, 609715, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this but it seems a bit tight.  I might zoom out and have more neg. space. ;~D</td>', 'I like the idea of this but it seems a bit tight.  I might zoom out and have more neg. space. ;~D', '2007-11-09 17:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4235318, 608811, 63503, '<td valign="top">Difficult to judge your take on the challenge. First, I must say this is stunningly beautiful image and I congratulate you on it. I suppose you could argue that most of the frame is iluminated by what remains of sunlight or perhaps moonlight, but, you have at least one other source in the city lights, and, most of all, you have numerous sources of light coming from the stars; technically, each star would be a source of light. I would have given this image a 9 in some other challenge (free study? landscape? Tree?) but I feel it would be unfair to the other entries to do so here.</td>', 'Difficult to judge your take on the challenge. First, I must say this is stunningly beautiful image and I congratulate you on it. I suppose you could argue that most of the frame is iluminated by what remains of sunlight or perhaps moonlight, but, you have at least one other source in the city lights, and, most of all, you have numerous sources of light coming from the stars; technically, each star would be a source of light. I would have given this image a 9 in some other challenge (free study? landscape? Tree?) but I feel it would be unfair to the other entries to do so here.', '2007-11-09 17:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4235327, 609483, 63503, '<td valign="top">Several light sources. DNMC</td>', 'Several light sources. DNMC', '2007-11-09 17:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
