(4236465, 609770, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like this. Dramatic lighting, crisp picture, original thought and appealing composition. Don''t understand a bit of your title, but it''s not a title challenge. (8)</td>', 'I like this. Dramatic lighting, crisp picture, original thought and appealing composition. Don''t understand a bit of your title, but it''s not a title challenge. (8)', '2007-11-10 03:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
