(4236467, 609770, 68956, '<td valign="top">Lovely simple graphic image, excellent focus. Shadows are important in this type of shot and yours really add to the image, I think it''s cropped a little too close to the right therefore, as they are a major element in the shot. Overall a great shot though, one of my top picks for this challenge, well done :)</td>', 'Lovely simple graphic image, excellent focus. Shadows are important in this type of shot and yours really add to the image, I think it''s cropped a little too close to the right therefore, as they are a major element in the shot. Overall a great shot though, one of my top picks for this challenge, well done :)', '2007-11-10 03:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4236470, 608670, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like this one as a picture. I do have serious doubts about this pic being made using a single lightsource however. Since I am not sure, I will not vote. If you did use a single lightsource, I am pretty curious as to how you did it.</td>', 'I like this one as a picture. I do have serious doubts about this pic being made using a single lightsource however. Since I am not sure, I will not vote. If you did use a single lightsource, I am pretty curious as to how you did it.', '2007-11-10 03:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4236471, 609517, 68956, '<td valign="top">Excellent way to get a single light source - the half open bedroom door illuminating a sleeping child. Did he win a medal that day? If so, well done to both of you ;)</td>', 'Excellent way to get a single light source - the half open bedroom door illuminating a sleeping child. Did he win a medal that day? If so, well done to both of you ;)', '2007-11-10 03:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
