(4237255, 608986, 68586, '<td valign="top">I rather like this. I wonder whether it would have been worth cropping in a little from the left so you had the plane in one corner (upper left) and the sun in the diagonally opposite one (lower right) ?<br/> <br/>That might have just brought a little more tension to the picture, and there isn''t anything specific to the left of the plane anyway.<br/> <br/>Good shot though.</td>', 'I rather like this. I wonder whether it would have been worth cropping in a little from the left so you had the plane in one corner (upper left) and the sun in the diagonally opposite one (lower right) ? That might have just brought a little more tension to the picture, and there isn''t anything specific to the left of the plane anyway. Good shot though.', '2007-11-10 15:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237256, 609905, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried this on two monitors and I''m afraid it''s still a bit too dark for me.</td>', 'I''ve tried this on two monitors and I''m afraid it''s still a bit too dark for me.', '2007-11-10 15:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237271, 609768, 68586, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the DoF here - the near breast is mostly out the light and the far breast is mostly out of focus.<br/> <br/>The problem is it leaves the viewer without a clear focal point to catch them and draw them in. I find myself looking at the area between her breaasts and of course there is nothing there for the eye to rest on. Maybe if you had gone for a different necklace coming further down her chest ?</td>', 'Not sure about the DoF here - the near breast is mostly out the light and the far breast is mostly out of focus. The problem is it leaves the viewer without a clear focal point to catch them and draw them in. I find myself looking at the area between her breaasts and of course there is nothing there for the eye to rest on. Maybe if you had gone for a different necklace coming further down her chest ?', '2007-11-10 16:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
