(4237592, 609912, 77543, '<td valign="top">A fairly ordinary attempt at the, perhaps, over done water drop. Alas this shot is not sufficiently unique or well executed to excite me. It''s not straight, the background is too busy, the water is not crystal sharp, the shape of the splash is uninteresting.</td>', 'A fairly ordinary attempt at the, perhaps, over done water drop. Alas this shot is not sufficiently unique or well executed to excite me. It''s not straight, the background is too busy, the water is not crystal sharp, the shape of the splash is uninteresting.', '2007-11-10 19:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237597, 609931, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good exposure. shame about, what look like, dirty marks.</td>', 'Good exposure. shame about, what look like, dirty marks.', '2007-11-10 19:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237600, 609816, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good idea to have the light coming from the book. It''s well positioned in the frame with a good crop.</td>', 'Good idea to have the light coming from the book. It''s well positioned in the frame with a good crop.', '2007-11-10 19:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237606, 609744, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good simple idea but let down by the thumbs being unsymmetrical, the focus being a bit soft, the exposure being slightly over and, perhaps, being slightly too small in the frame. I''d have gone with a tighter crop.</td>', 'Good simple idea but let down by the thumbs being unsymmetrical, the focus being a bit soft, the exposure being slightly over and, perhaps, being slightly too small in the frame. I''d have gone with a tighter crop.', '2007-11-10 19:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237611, 609948, 77543, '<td valign="top">If this is one skull then the positioning of the mirrors is very good. I don''t like the top and bottom border.</td>', 'If this is one skull then the positioning of the mirrors is very good. I don''t like the top and bottom border.', '2007-11-10 19:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237614, 609793, 77543, '<td valign="top">The water is well lit and sharp but I''d like to see the hands equally well lit and in focus to give more context to the shot.</td>', 'The water is well lit and sharp but I''d like to see the hands equally well lit and in focus to give more context to the shot.', '2007-11-10 19:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237615, 609951, 60173, '<td valign="top">Im not sure I''m completely sold on this image, but I can see great potential with your idea. I love the colors, and your exposure seems to be dead on.<br/> <br/>This is a subject that works very well as a centered subject. Unfortunately, you''re not centered perfectly, and you''ve lost some of that initial impact. <br/> <br/>The border is also not doing anything for the photo. Perhaps if the border were a solid, sharp line. It looks like you may have used a fuzzy/feathered brush to create your border. As it is now, you''ve already got a lot of fuzzy elements. The sharpness would give the viewer''s eyes something to hold on to, and would bring the sharpness of the glass throughout the photo. Again, adding more impact.</td>', 'Im not sure I''m completely sold on this image, but I can see great potential with your idea. I love the colors, and your exposure seems to be dead on. This is a subject that works very well as a centered subject. Unfortunately, you''re not centered perfectly, and you''ve lost some of that initial impact.  The border is also not doing anything for the photo. Perhaps if the border were a solid, sharp line. It looks like you may have used a fuzzy/feathered brush to create your border. As it is now, you''ve already got a lot of fuzzy elements. The sharpness would give the viewer''s eyes something to hold on to, and would bring the sharpness of the glass throughout the photo. Again, adding more impact.', '2007-11-10 19:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237623, 609315, 77543, '<td valign="top">Very good but I notice it''s not centred and there''s an odd shape at the lower left. Yes -I''m being picky.</td>', 'Very good but I notice it''s not centred and there''s an odd shape at the lower left. Yes -I''m being picky.', '2007-11-10 19:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237625, 609306, 77543, '<td valign="top">Only the top right seems to be sharp. I think I''d need to see more to get more context.</td>', 'Only the top right seems to be sharp. I think I''d need to see more to get more context.', '2007-11-10 19:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237630, 609850, 77543, '<td valign="top">Very stark. I think the white areas on the teapot work but I don''t like the glare in the black area at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'Very stark. I think the white areas on the teapot work but I don''t like the glare in the black area at the bottom of the frame.', '2007-11-10 19:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237634, 609318, 77543, '<td valign="top">This is excellently lit and a very interesting subject.</td>', 'This is excellently lit and a very interesting subject.', '2007-11-10 19:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237637, 607271, 77543, '<td valign="top">This appears to have been lit by more than one light source.</td>', 'This appears to have been lit by more than one light source.', '2007-11-10 19:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237639, 607979, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d  crop tighter to remove the unnecessary lights in the right hand side background. It''s a shame we can''t see his eyes.</td>', 'I''d  crop tighter to remove the unnecessary lights in the right hand side background. It''s a shame we can''t see his eyes.', '2007-11-10 19:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237642, 609784, 77543, '<td valign="top">The yellow flower is much brighter than the red. I think the bottom red flower should have been wholly in the frame - perhaps with a portrait crop.</td>', 'The yellow flower is much brighter than the red. I think the bottom red flower should have been wholly in the frame - perhaps with a portrait crop.', '2007-11-10 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237643, 609173, 77543, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2007-11-10 20:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237644, 609021, 77543, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Perhaps too saturated.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Perhaps too saturated.', '2007-11-10 20:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237646, 609376, 77543, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped to the edge of the desk.</td>', 'I would have cropped to the edge of the desk.', '2007-11-10 20:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237648, 608800, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good lightly revealing a surprising amount of colour. A pity about the lens flare at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'Good lightly revealing a surprising amount of colour. A pity about the lens flare at the bottom of the frame.', '2007-11-10 20:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237649, 608508, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s a very large shadow behind your model. Don''t be afraid to move your furniture further from the wall.<br/> <br/>There''s also no true blacks or whites in the photo, which is causing it to look very flat to me. I use Curves in Photoshop to make sure I have whites and blacks set to create the best depth. With this photo I used the black eyedropper in Curves to make the blacks blacker. Doing this made your subject pop right out of the background.</td>', 'There''s a very large shadow behind your model. Don''t be afraid to move your furniture further from the wall. There''s also no true blacks or whites in the photo, which is causing it to look very flat to me. I use Curves in Photoshop to make sure I have whites and blacks set to create the best depth. With this photo I used the black eyedropper in Curves to make the blacks blacker. Doing this made your subject pop right out of the background.', '2007-11-10 20:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237651, 608662, 77543, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject and shadow. Unfortunately there is no sense of depth in this picture which is needed to convey the 3D nature of the subject. Perhaps a lower camera angle would have helped.</td>', 'An interesting subject and shadow. Unfortunately there is no sense of depth in this picture which is needed to convey the 3D nature of the subject. Perhaps a lower camera angle would have helped.', '2007-11-10 20:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237653, 609867, 77543, '<td valign="top">I need to see more detail in the objects on the plate. The problem is with the limited size of the pictures we can post. The lighting is good.</td>', 'I need to see more detail in the objects on the plate. The problem is with the limited size of the pictures we can post. The lighting is good.', '2007-11-10 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237655, 609943, 77543, '<td valign="top">Perfect expose.</td>', 'Perfect expose.', '2007-11-10 20:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237660, 608183, 77543, '<td valign="top">Better if the subject was centred between the fence and the wall.</td>', 'Better if the subject was centred between the fence and the wall.', '2007-11-10 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237665, 608029, 60173, '<td valign="top">This was probably a tough subject to shoot. Your whites are blown into a blob of white at the bottom, but if you had bumped up your shutter speed, you probably would have lost detail in the top of the unicorn.<br/> <br/>While the colors are nice, and your subject is probably something very pretty to have in your house, it will not likely do well here in a photo. Photos of "stuff" generally don''t score well.<br/> <br/>We''ve all taken photos of "stuff" to work on technique, but generally it''s not something you should enter into a photo contest.</td>', 'This was probably a tough subject to shoot. Your whites are blown into a blob of white at the bottom, but if you had bumped up your shutter speed, you probably would have lost detail in the top of the unicorn. While the colors are nice, and your subject is probably something very pretty to have in your house, it will not likely do well here in a photo. Photos of "stuff" generally don''t score well. We''ve all taken photos of "stuff" to work on technique, but generally it''s not something you should enter into a photo contest.', '2007-11-10 20:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237667, 607791, 60173, '<td valign="top">I have to point out the obvious... This is a "Single Light Source" challenge, and you have 5 light sources visible, and 2 that are right above you.</td>', 'I have to point out the obvious... This is a "Single Light Source" challenge, and you have 5 light sources visible, and 2 that are right above you.', '2007-11-10 20:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237671, 609917, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and your technique seems to have given you good results. However, the wall in the background looks like it''s chopping her head off. Perhaps a solid color/texture wall would work better?</td>', 'I like the idea, and your technique seems to have given you good results. However, the wall in the background looks like it''s chopping her head off. Perhaps a solid color/texture wall would work better?', '2007-11-10 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237675, 609816, 78755, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - the title makes it perfect for the image you created.  Nice contrast between the light and dark, and the man''s face is hard to ignore - he seems so interested in finding the way by reading the letters.  i just can''t explain it, but this is my favorite pick of them all!</td>', 'I really like this shot - the title makes it perfect for the image you created.  Nice contrast between the light and dark, and the man''s face is hard to ignore - he seems so interested in finding the way by reading the letters.  i just can''t explain it, but this is my favorite pick of them all!', '2007-11-10 20:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237677, 609158, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think you''re slightly underexposed on this.</td>', 'I think you''re slightly underexposed on this.', '2007-11-10 20:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4237678, 608904, 60173, '<td valign="top">The irony is that, I think this is underexposed.</td>', 'The irony is that, I think this is underexposed.', '2007-11-10 20:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
