(4237811, 607271, 86498, '<td valign="top">Look at that Archaic smile! I think this is a perfect example of the fact that even though art changes, it doesn''t get better. Even an ancient kouros has its place in the DP Challenge. And so you see...I give it a 10.</td>', 'Look at that Archaic smile! I think this is a perfect example of the fact that even though art changes, it doesn''t get better. Even an ancient kouros has its place in the DP Challenge. And so you see...I give it a 10.', '2007-11-10 21:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
