(4240208, 609342, 61336, '<td valign="top">I think you got a diamond here but it''s a little crude. Two minutes pp would make it shine.</td>', 'I think you got a diamond here but it''s a little crude. Two minutes pp would make it shine.', '2007-11-12 04:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
