(4243646, 609679, 69102, '<td valign="top">lighting on this is nice, although the shadow in the upper right seems out of place and doesn''t add to the composition for me. some of the detail seems a bit washed out.</td>', 'lighting on this is nice, although the shadow in the upper right seems out of place and doesn''t add to the composition for me. some of the detail seems a bit washed out.', '2007-11-13 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243651, 609905, 69102, '<td valign="top">too dark on my monitor; seems like there is some interesting lighting going on here, but can''t even really get a handle on the subject because just not enough light</td>', 'too dark on my monitor; seems like there is some interesting lighting going on here, but can''t even really get a handle on the subject because just not enough light', '2007-11-13 10:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4243653, 609402, 69102, '<td valign="top">like the strong side lighting; not sure if what i''m seeing is a post processing effect, or just a bit of camera shake, but the effect detracts from the image; the way the shadow cuts off her lips so that they turn down in the middle is very unflattering</td>', 'like the strong side lighting; not sure if what i''m seeing is a post processing effect, or just a bit of camera shake, but the effect detracts from the image; the way the shadow cuts off her lips so that they turn down in the middle is very unflattering', '2007-11-13 10:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
