(4244287, 609770, 80912, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like it better w/ more dof - to see the shadow interact w/ the pattern of the table (or floor?)</td>', 'I think I''d like it better w/ more dof - to see the shadow interact w/ the pattern of the table (or floor?)', '2007-11-13 16:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244299, 609744, 80912, '<td valign="top">oh, man - just move that thumb a bit, lol.</td>', 'oh, man - just move that thumb a bit, lol.', '2007-11-13 16:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244344, 607271, 86573, '<td valign="top">wow..all i can say is amazing!...and the light source from ceiling lights...unbeliveable!! This deserves an automatic 10!!</td>', 'wow..all i can say is amazing!...and the light source from ceiling lights...unbeliveable!! This deserves an automatic 10!!', '2007-11-13 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244377, 609676, 56167, '<td valign="top">Love the shades in this one, good focus and lighting, well done</td>', 'Love the shades in this one, good focus and lighting, well done', '2007-11-13 17:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244405, 608821, 42256, '<td valign="top">Would have been such a wonderful shot for this challenge, if only the subject was not in motion, stairs were straight horizontally, but I guess your title itself suggests you consider it a snapshot yourself!</td>', 'Would have been such a wonderful shot for this challenge, if only the subject was not in motion, stairs were straight horizontally, but I guess your title itself suggests you consider it a snapshot yourself!', '2007-11-13 17:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244411, 609687, 42256, '<td valign="top">Would have worked really well with a little more light. Negative space is not really doing much for this picture, also the black line in the bottom is distracting! Nice try with the single source of light!</td>', 'Would have worked really well with a little more light. Negative space is not really doing much for this picture, also the black line in the bottom is distracting! Nice try with the single source of light!', '2007-11-13 17:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244440, 609430, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and sharpness.. editing here has the style of one of my favorite photographers here at DPC .. but I have a feeling you are not the same photographer I am thinking of .. anyways 8</td>', 'Beautiful tones and sharpness.. editing here has the style of one of my favorite photographers here at DPC .. but I have a feeling you are not the same photographer I am thinking of .. anyways 8', '2007-11-13 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244441, 609483, 85464, '<td valign="top">I count 17 separate light sources...</td>', 'I count 17 separate light sources...', '2007-11-13 17:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244453, 608673, 85464, '<td valign="top">not an artificial light source!</td>', 'not an artificial light source!', '2007-11-13 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244476, 607776, 85464, '<td valign="top">Scandanavian?</td>', 'Scandanavian?', '2007-11-13 17:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244487, 609817, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice imagery here - the lighting &amp; arrangement offer great interest. Though I like the selective DOF, the part in focus still comes off a bit soft (it might because of the art on the dolls is soft).   The hard blooming on the extreme right is a little distracting, too.   One of my top ten for this challenge... &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Nice imagery here - the lighting & arrangement offer great interest. Though I like the selective DOF, the part in focus still comes off a bit soft (it might because of the art on the dolls is soft).   The hard blooming on the extreme right is a little distracting, too.   One of my top ten for this challenge... << 8 >>', '2007-11-13 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244490, 608392, 67841, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting &amp; arrangement.  Love the yin/yang relationship of the leaves.  Nice concept that was beautifully executed!  One of my top ten for this challenge... &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Fabulous lighting & arrangement.  Love the yin/yang relationship of the leaves.  Nice concept that was beautifully executed!  One of my top ten for this challenge... << 8 >>', '2007-11-13 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244493, 609943, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the shades, detail &amp; contrast here  - back to bump up to an 8.</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the shades, detail & contrast here  - back to bump up to an 8.', '2007-11-13 17:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244494, 608965, 67841, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2007-11-13 17:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244496, 608904, 67841, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but the form is superb...  &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'A little dark, but the form is superb...  << 7 >>', '2007-11-13 17:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244499, 609342, 67841, '<td valign="top">Bravo - though I have 5 of my own (or perhaps because) I never succumb to baby shots here at DPC... ''til now!  <br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Bravo - though I have 5 of my own (or perhaps because) I never succumb to baby shots here at DPC... ''til now!   << 8 >>', '2007-11-13 17:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244503, 608481, 67841, '<td valign="top">Fabulous color &amp; imagery.  I only wish I didn''t see the umbrella reflection in the glass (I know its hard!)<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Fabulous color & imagery.  I only wish I didn''t see the umbrella reflection in the glass (I know its hard!) << 7 >>', '2007-11-13 17:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244504, 609186, 67841, '<td valign="top">Beautiful smoke capture...  &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Beautiful smoke capture...  << 7 >>', '2007-11-13 17:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244561, 608508, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely young lady.  The angle of the light makes it come across quite harshly; coming in from one side might make for a more interesting picture.</td>', 'Lovely young lady.  The angle of the light makes it come across quite harshly; coming in from one side might make for a more interesting picture.', '2007-11-13 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244567, 609424, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely cat!  Nice job to get catchlights in both eyes but have the face partly shadowed.</td>', 'Lovely cat!  Nice job to get catchlights in both eyes but have the face partly shadowed.', '2007-11-13 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244574, 609826, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lovely instrument (and your title has me humming a VERY old song!).  An angled composition might add even more interest to the image.</td>', 'Looks like a lovely instrument (and your title has me humming a VERY old song!).  An angled composition might add even more interest to the image.', '2007-11-13 18:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244597, 609722, 65234, '<td valign="top">Had to stare at this for awhile, but I *think* I''m seeing a sculpture of a cat inside someone''s head.  And then, on the cat, a shadow (or another part of the sculpture) which looks like an ancient Egyptian image of a god, or maybe a person.  Layers of complexity.  Photographically, I find it hard to comment except to say you succeeded in making this look old and worn, and your subject is intriguing to me.</td>', 'Had to stare at this for awhile, but I *think* I''m seeing a sculpture of a cat inside someone''s head.  And then, on the cat, a shadow (or another part of the sculpture) which looks like an ancient Egyptian image of a god, or maybe a person.  Layers of complexity.  Photographically, I find it hard to comment except to say you succeeded in making this look old and worn, and your subject is intriguing to me.', '2007-11-13 18:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244646, 608464, 65234, '<td valign="top">Amen :-)  You already got "adorable" so you should quit while you''re ahead!</td>', 'Amen :-)  You already got "adorable" so you should quit while you''re ahead!', '2007-11-13 18:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244649, 608662, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice shadow.</td>', 'Very nice shadow.', '2007-11-13 18:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244652, 609315, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ack!  Freaky eyes.</td>', 'Ack!  Freaky eyes.', '2007-11-13 18:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244664, 609342, 65234, '<td valign="top">The angle and lighting are beautiful and soft and ... there''s that one bright target in the baby''s eye I desperately want to clone out!!!</td>', 'The angle and lighting are beautiful and soft and ... there''s that one bright target in the baby''s eye I desperately want to clone out!!!', '2007-11-13 18:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244665, 609761, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice angle; simple, pretty.</td>', 'Nice angle; simple, pretty.', '2007-11-13 18:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244694, 608670, 65234, '<td valign="top">Creative and very well done.  Just enough light to tell the story.</td>', 'Creative and very well done.  Just enough light to tell the story.', '2007-11-13 19:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244724, 608800, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and composed; kind of a bad hair day effect.  Little blob of light to the right of the stem takes away a little bit from the main subject.</td>', 'Nicely lit and composed; kind of a bad hair day effect.  Little blob of light to the right of the stem takes away a little bit from the main subject.', '2007-11-13 19:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244726, 609801, 78137, '<td valign="top">LoL, techniquly that''s a bunch light sources BUT I like it .. 10!</td>', 'LoL, techniquly that''s a bunch light sources BUT I like it .. 10!', '2007-11-13 19:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244727, 609920, 65234, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice effect.  Looks like it would make a nice print, actually.</td>', 'Simple but nice effect.  Looks like it would make a nice print, actually.', '2007-11-13 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244730, 609731, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely how the light plays off the paperweight.  A tighter crop on the left and bottom would give this more impact, IMO.</td>', 'Lovely how the light plays off the paperweight.  A tighter crop on the left and bottom would give this more impact, IMO.', '2007-11-13 19:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244733, 609851, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unusual flower view, but quite nice.  Feels Oriental in design.</td>', 'Unusual flower view, but quite nice.  Feels Oriental in design.', '2007-11-13 19:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244735, 608964, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice; not blown out and plenty of detail.  Simple, but nice.</td>', 'Very nice; not blown out and plenty of detail.  Simple, but nice.', '2007-11-13 19:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244738, 609798, 78137, '<td valign="top">something about this makes me dizzy... maybe it''s just the angle.. nice though</td>', 'something about this makes me dizzy... maybe it''s just the angle.. nice though', '2007-11-13 19:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244739, 608152, 70036, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Blown out highlights in a low light situation are tough.  Perhaps a bit too sharpened.  But can tell you really embraced the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Blown out highlights in a low light situation are tough.  Perhaps a bit too sharpened.  But can tell you really embraced the challenge.', '2007-11-13 19:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244740, 608190, 65234, '<td valign="top">This feels cozy to look at.  Like being at someone''s grandma''s house. (Note: I liked my grandma, so that''s a good thing.)</td>', 'This feels cozy to look at.  Like being at someone''s grandma''s house. (Note: I liked my grandma, so that''s a good thing.)', '2007-11-13 19:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244743, 608306, 78137, '<td valign="top">great DOF</td>', 'great DOF', '2007-11-13 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244745, 609798, 70036, '<td valign="top">Lack of focus hurts this.  Greater DOF would have helped.  And the lighting is flat, not dramatic.  Does make me hungry.</td>', 'Lack of focus hurts this.  Greater DOF would have helped.  And the lighting is flat, not dramatic.  Does make me hungry.', '2007-11-13 19:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244747, 609186, 70036, '<td valign="top">More smoke....   A very good job, however.</td>', 'More smoke....   A very good job, however.', '2007-11-13 19:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244748, 608464, 70036, '<td valign="top">Good image but no dramatic lighting.  Flat lighting.</td>', 'Good image but no dramatic lighting.  Flat lighting.', '2007-11-13 19:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244749, 609915, 78137, '<td valign="top">LoL.. that''s great</td>', 'LoL.. that''s great', '2007-11-13 19:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244750, 609673, 65234, '<td valign="top">Woody looks like he''s really enjoying his book.  Pose is really quite nice (except I''m trying not to look at the hands that look like horse''s hooves) and reminds me of a kid lost in an adventure.  Like the lighting, too.  Have to say this is one of the best Woody pix I''ve seen in a very long time.</td>', 'Woody looks like he''s really enjoying his book.  Pose is really quite nice (except I''m trying not to look at the hands that look like horse''s hooves) and reminds me of a kid lost in an adventure.  Like the lighting, too.  Have to say this is one of the best Woody pix I''ve seen in a very long time.', '2007-11-13 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244751, 609937, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice angle; she looks noble.  Might like it cropped a little more tightly left and right.</td>', 'Nice angle; she looks noble.  Might like it cropped a little more tightly left and right.', '2007-11-13 19:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244752, 608662, 78137, '<td valign="top">NICE! 10!</td>', 'NICE! 10!', '2007-11-13 19:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244755, 609392, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect you got here.  My daughter is in med school; I bet she can relate to this!</td>', 'Very nice effect you got here.  My daughter is in med school; I bet she can relate to this!', '2007-11-13 19:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244757, 608665, 70036, '<td valign="top">Good composition.   Blown out highlights in eyes, nose and earing detract a bit. Nice soft edges.  Very good lighting.</td>', 'Good composition.   Blown out highlights in eyes, nose and earing detract a bit. Nice soft edges.  Very good lighting.', '2007-11-13 19:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244758, 609906, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is quite stark, but I like it a lot.  Very challenging expression.  I particularly like the bit of light on the inside part of the iris ... adds some detail where I don''t normally expect to find it.</td>', 'This is quite stark, but I like it a lot.  Very challenging expression.  I particularly like the bit of light on the inside part of the iris ... adds some detail where I don''t normally expect to find it.', '2007-11-13 19:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244761, 608214, 70036, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  Dramatic.  Negative space kind of swallows the subject.</td>', 'Great lighting.  Dramatic.  Negative space kind of swallows the subject.', '2007-11-13 19:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244762, 609913, 65234, '<td valign="top">My favorite of this challenge''s cat pictures.  Very nice detail and the eyes are lit perfectly.</td>', 'My favorite of this challenge''s cat pictures.  Very nice detail and the eyes are lit perfectly.', '2007-11-13 19:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244763, 608488, 70036, '<td valign="top">Wish I could see her face.</td>', 'Wish I could see her face.', '2007-11-13 19:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244765, 609664, 70036, '<td valign="top">Composition begs to move to the thirds or to the center.  Dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Composition begs to move to the thirds or to the center.  Dramatic lighting.', '2007-11-13 19:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244768, 609934, 70036, '<td valign="top">great portrait.  Good lighting.</td>', 'great portrait.  Good lighting.', '2007-11-13 19:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244769, 609484, 30214, '<td valign="top">very interesting inversion! took me a while to figure it out.</td>', 'very interesting inversion! took me a while to figure it out.', '2007-11-13 19:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244771, 609741, 70036, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus and in need of contrast.  Good composition.</td>', 'A bit out of focus and in need of contrast.  Good composition.', '2007-11-13 19:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244774, 607979, 30214, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2007-11-13 19:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244776, 608965, 70036, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.   Great lighting.</td>', 'Very beautiful.   Great lighting.', '2007-11-13 19:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4244779, 609402, 70036, '<td valign="top">Good lighting.  But graininess detracts.</td>', 'Good lighting.  But graininess detracts.', '2007-11-13 19:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
