(4244852, 608481, 70036, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  Star is on the thirds but the negative space on the left bothers me a bit.  Good PP.   Good job exposing the glass.  Glass is very hard - with blown out highlights usually.  You did really well with controlling the exposure and with PP.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great lighting.  Star is on the thirds but the negative space on the left bothers me a bit.  Good PP.   Good job exposing the glass.  Glass is very hard - with blown out highlights usually.  You did really well with controlling the exposure and with PP.  Very nice.', '2007-11-13 19:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
