(4244911, 609245, 70036, '<td valign="top">Yes!  There is this tension where I want the orange to move, but it doesn''t.  The use of negative space is very well done.  The relationship of the orange to  the black space is powerful.   The simplicity of this image works very well.  This is what photography is all about.</td>', 'Yes!  There is this tension where I want the orange to move, but it doesn''t.  The use of negative space is very well done.  The relationship of the orange to  the black space is powerful.   The simplicity of this image works very well.  This is what photography is all about.', '2007-11-13 20:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
