(4245756, 609245, 70689, '<td valign="top">Post Challenge: Thanks for the many kind comments. I was a bit surprised by people saying there was too much open space. Have they ever looked at the amount of open space around the moon? ;) Still, their comments are helpful, as they help me understand the score. I am very happy with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=70036" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">alexzen</a>''s comment, because it tells me that I succeeded in conveying my idea to at least one person. I was a bit suprised of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=80058" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">booboo_goon</a>''s comment. Why does a self-proclaimed minimalist wish there was more to see? ;)</td>', 'Post Challenge: Thanks for the many kind comments. I was a bit surprised by people saying there was too much open space. Have they ever looked at the amount of open space around the moon? ;) Still, their comments are helpful, as they help me understand the score. I am very happy with  alexzen''s comment, because it tells me that I succeeded in conveying my idea to at least one person. I was a bit suprised of  booboo_goon''s comment. Why does a self-proclaimed minimalist wish there was more to see? ;)', '2007-11-14 03:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
