(4246475, 609769, 11518, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by De Sousa:</b></div><hr/><i> Love this pic, love the concept, love the tremendous body painting. Everything is PERFECT!<br/>Hey Larus, do not give any importance to the few DPCers killing your work. You know how it is, and you can''t expect much from their minds. This is a great photograph with a stunning and beautiful model. I wish I could have your skills and your models too ;)<br/>Congrats, you always give us the best. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What he said!</td>', 'Originally posted by De Sousa: Love this pic, love the concept, love the tremendous body painting. Everything is PERFECT!Hey Larus, do not give any importance to the few DPCers killing your work. You know how it is, and you can''t expect much from their minds. This is a great photograph with a stunning and beautiful model. I wish I could have your skills and your models too ;)Congrats, you always give us the best.   What he said!', '2007-11-14 10:26:44.000000', NULL, 0),
