(4246858, 609948, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you shared how you accomplished this. I was wondering. I like the lighting and I like the border, which seems to be a problem for some people. My only regret is that I can''t see the top of the primary skull. That makes it feel like the border in intruding on the image.</td>', 'I''m glad you shared how you accomplished this. I was wondering. I like the lighting and I like the border, which seems to be a problem for some people. My only regret is that I can''t see the top of the primary skull. That makes it feel like the border in intruding on the image.', '2007-11-14 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
