(4247031, 608414, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty!  I was one of your 7''s - it was the color that sucked me in  :) <br/> <br/>I personally loved the color in the background - that is my fave part of your picture.  I know that people seem to want some order in these types of shots, but what I liked about it was the disorder.  That makes it seem more real and natural.</td>', 'This is so pretty!  I was one of your 7''s - it was the color that sucked me in  :)  I personally loved the color in the background - that is my fave part of your picture.  I know that people seem to want some order in these types of shots, but what I liked about it was the disorder.  That makes it seem more real and natural.', '2007-11-14 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4247044, 609667, 66106, '<td valign="top">&amp;#931;&amp;#965;&amp;#947;&amp;#967;&amp;#945;&amp;#961;&amp;#951;&amp;#964;&amp;#942;&amp;#961;&amp;#953;&amp;#945; &amp;#947;&amp;#953;&amp;#945; &amp;#964;&amp;#951;&amp;#957; 5&amp;#951; &amp;#952;&amp;#941;&amp;#963;&amp;#951;. &amp;#928;&amp;#959;&amp;#955;&amp;#973; &amp;#954;&amp;#945;&amp;#955;&amp;#942; &amp;#948;&amp;#959;&amp;#965;&amp;#955;&amp;#949;&amp;#953;&amp;#940;. &amp;#928;&amp;#959;&amp;#955;&amp;#955;&amp;#941;&amp;#962; &amp;#949;&amp;#960;&amp;#953;&amp;#964;&amp;#965;&amp;#967;&amp;#943;&amp;#949;&amp;#962; &amp;#964;&amp;#959;&amp;#957; &amp;#964;&amp;#949;&amp;#955;&amp;#949;&amp;#965;&amp;#964;&amp;#945;&amp;#943;&amp;#959; &amp;#954;&amp;#945;&amp;#953;&amp;#961;&amp;#972;. &amp;#924;&amp;#960;&amp;#961;&amp;#940;&amp;#946;&amp;#959;!!! &amp;#935;&amp;#945;&amp;#943;&amp;#961;&amp;#959;&amp;#956;&amp;#945;&amp;#953; &amp;#960;&amp;#959;&amp;#955;&amp;#973;.<br/></td>', '&#931;&#965;&#947;&#967;&#945;&#961;&#951;&#964;&#942;&#961;&#953;&#945; &#947;&#953;&#945; &#964;&#951;&#957; 5&#951; &#952;&#941;&#963;&#951;. &#928;&#959;&#955;&#973; &#954;&#945;&#955;&#942; &#948;&#959;&#965;&#955;&#949;&#953;&#940;. &#928;&#959;&#955;&#955;&#941;&#962; &#949;&#960;&#953;&#964;&#965;&#967;&#943;&#949;&#962; &#964;&#959;&#957; &#964;&#949;&#955;&#949;&#965;&#964;&#945;&#943;&#959; &#954;&#945;&#953;&#961;&#972;. &#924;&#960;&#961;&#940;&#946;&#959;!!! &#935;&#945;&#943;&#961;&#959;&#956;&#945;&#953; &#960;&#959;&#955;&#973;.', '2007-11-14 13:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
