(4247106, 609414, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m really really really hoping this is not one of YOUR dogs dressed up for Halloween.  Of course, I guess if they are shown snarling in your future pics, then we will know.  <br/> <br/>I love the blur.  It enhances the feeling of a dog trying to quickly run away before it can be caught wearing a tutu.<br/> <br/>lol what a riot.</td>', 'I''m really really really hoping this is not one of YOUR dogs dressed up for Halloween.  Of course, I guess if they are shown snarling in your future pics, then we will know.   I love the blur.  It enhances the feeling of a dog trying to quickly run away before it can be caught wearing a tutu. lol what a riot.', '2007-11-14 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 0),
