(4248769, 608280, 81461, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your helpful comments.<br/>@DistantColours, in retrospect I agree with you. I''m not clever enough to manage it with a single light source yet. Maybe one day...<br/>@dmadden, yes I did paint with light. And yes, it could be a bit brighter in some areas. For impact, the following photo in my photostream is a little better.<br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/samantsumit/1841688389/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.flickr.com/photos/samantsumit/1841688389/</a> <br/>Nevertheless, for my first ever entry, I don''t think I can complain. I will strive to get better and appreciate your comments, criticism and compliments.<br/>Thanks to all of you for finding the time to comment.</td>', 'Thanks for your helpful comments.@DistantColours, in retrospect I agree with you. I''m not clever enough to manage it with a single light source yet. Maybe one day...@dmadden, yes I did paint with light. And yes, it could be a bit brighter in some areas. For impact, the following photo in my photostream is a little better.//www.flickr.com/photos/samantsumit/1841688389/ Nevertheless, for my first ever entry, I don''t think I can complain. I will strive to get better and appreciate your comments, criticism and compliments.Thanks to all of you for finding the time to comment.', '2007-11-15 07:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
